n is submitted in entirety in G K  The smaller fragment is bivalved to reveal a tan white fibrous cut surface  This small fragment as well as the serially sectioned  thin membranous piece are submitted entirely in L M  Resident  JOHN BISSONNETTE  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  RIGHT  BIOPSY  DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU AND INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA  INVASIVE CARCINOMA IS PRESENT AT THE INKED MARGIN  O R  Resident  LAURENCE DE LEVAL  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Robert Henry Young  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  James Warren May Jr   M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  IMPLANT  RIGHT BREAST  PART C  IMPLANT  LEFT BREAST  PART D  BREAST  RIGHT   ADDITIONAL MARGIN , Yes.
