OSIS  1  FAVOR PHYLLOIDES TUMOR  O R  Resident  STUART HOUSER  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Suzanne B  Keel  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST AND SKIN TISSUE   report_end  , Not_reported.
