 REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  This tan white  firm to rubbery ill defined area lies 0 6cm from overlying anterior inked margin and 2 8cm from posterior inked margin  Approximately 2 5cm lateral to this third ill defined area present a possible fourth mass which measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  This tan white  ill defined  rubbery area grossly abuts the overlying anterior inked margin and lies 4 5cm from posterior inked margin  The remaining breast parenchyma contains dense tan white  rubbery fibrous tissue which contains numerous cysts with blue fluid  consistent with blue domed cyst  No additional discrete mass or lesion is noted  The upper outer quadrant tissue is palpated for lymph nodes and no lymph nodes are grossly appreciated  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  mass  1  upper outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire second mass  central quadrant  12 1 o clock    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire third possible mass to include anterior and posterior inked margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire fourth possible mass to include anterior and posterior inked margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma between first and second mass   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma between second and third mass   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma between third and fourth mass   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma  upper inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  fibrous breast parenchyma  inner lower quadrant  INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION   1  RIGHT AXILLARY LYMPH NODE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON  1 QUANTITATIVE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR HER 2 c erbB 2 Breast  Right  block  REMOVED_ACCESS